      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I discovered that in some layers don't work with stickers. But there no documentation of how it works. Also this required to change the layers of the objects, if I am using a layer for a specific purpose then that is not a good option. Making a component that can attach to triggers and tell the game that the trigger is a no sticker zone would be a better solution and also communicate to the user where you can place stickers or not.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
