        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with this 100%. I think it's bad that people can place stickers on video players for example, or if you want to be more malicouse some worlds have advertising posters with QR codes, swop the QR code out with a custom one using stickers. That just opens up a can of bad worms. If world creators had more control of where stickers could and couldn't be placed, this would allow world creators to prevent stickers on specific surfaces like advertisment posters or video players.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
